  "description": "A fully-fledged C# dialect of SQL — fluent, type-safe SELECT and DML (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE) for .NET 6+. Covers every ANSI SQL clause with full identifier quoting for SQL Server, MySQL/MariaDB, SQLite, PostgreSQL, and ANSI Generic dialects. Configure once at startup via QBuilderConfig, use named configs for multiple databases. Produces parameterized SQL strings you execute with Dapper, ADO.NET, or any micro-ORM. Zero boilerplate, injection-safe, 255 tests. v9.2 adds POCO convenience: FromObject/FromObjects for INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE, QBatch for multi-statement round-trips, and QKey/QIgnore/QColumn attributes.",
  "id": "Jattac.Libraries.QBuilder",
